{
  "name": "chat-lc-lite-guardrail",
  "description": "Refusal-decision suite for Chat LangChain Lite. 22 examples in three buckets: 8 that must be refused (out of scope, or an unsafe practice), 6 prompt-injection and instruction-disclosure attempts that must be refused, and 8 benign in-scope questions that must be answered. Scored by refusal_decision_correct, so refusing everything scores as badly as refusing nothing.",
